# Cloudflare Tunnel Integration

- [ ] Install `cloudflared` in the WSL environment [/]
- [ ] Authenticate `cloudflared` with the user's Cloudflare account [ ]
- [ ] Create a new tunnel for the home server [ ]
- [ ] Configure the tunnel (config.yml) to route traffic: [ ]
    - [ ] Root domain -> CasaOS (port 80)
    - [ ] `api.domain` -> Flask App (port 5001)
- [ ] Set up the tunnel as a systemd service for persistence [ ]
- [ ] Verify external access via the new domain [ ]
